v58_e01_on_stack_main	open: a deep recursion ends in Node's RangeError (Maximum call stack size exceeded), not error 256
v58_e02_off_stack_main	open: a deep recursion ends in Node's RangeError, not error 256
v58_e03_none_stack_main	open: a deep recursion ends in Node's RangeError, not error 256
v58_e04_on_stack_include	open: a deep recursion ends in Node's RangeError, not error 256
